1)  As other people suggested, the nearest place to safely pray is
Vlad's tower.  If you happen to have any scroll of teleportation handy
(you were planning to levelport to the bottom right after killing the
wizard, right?), a confused teleport will levelport you, and even a
random 'port should take you somewhere from which you can reach safety.


2)  The Heart of Ahriman can be invoked to toggle levitation, so I
wouldn't worry about the ring.

3)  If you wait around long enough, the wizard should appear again and
will eventually summon nasties, which I believe inlcudes nymphs, but
also includes a lot of other... well, nasties.  He could also curse
more of your stuff (like the BoH), so I wouldn't recommend this option.


